  Reading rule (arithmetic about an OBSERVED interval, not power and
  not a statement about true effects): with realised half-width h,
  MATERIAL+ needs the observed point > 10 + h, and NULL(10) needs
  |observed point| <= 10 - h. NULL(10) is unreachable whenever h > 10.
